@gateway = http://localhost:5100
@token = REPLACE_WITH_IDENTITY_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Gateway process health
GET {{gateway}}/health

### Identity route
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/auths/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Organization route
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/tenants?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Internal routes must not be exposed (404)
GET {{gateway}}/internal/v1/tenants
